<div id="shop">
  <section class="intro intro-shop">
    <div class="d-flex container flex-column flex-md-row align-items-center align-items-md-end justify-content-center justify-content-md-between h-100">
      <div class="title-wrapper">
        <h1 class="mb-0">shop so</h1>
        <h1 class="mb-0">you don't drop</h1>
      </div>
      <div></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="belly">
    <div class="row m-0">
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 belly-height belly-left">
        <div class="belly-text">
          <h2 class="mb-0">from my</h2>
          <h2 class="mb-0">happy <span class="blue">belly</span></h2>
          <h2 class="last">to yours.</h2>
          <p class="blue pure-text mb-0">Pure, vegan, and homemade goodies.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-12 col-md-6 belly-height belly-right">
        <p>In 2020 I had some friends over for brunch and decided to whip up a meal made entirely from scratch - from the sweet potato fatbread to the almond butter. I spent an entire morning preparing.</p>
        <p>My almond butter was a hit! After some prompting and motivation from loved ones, I started making and selling almond butter while studying for my Health Coaching certifcate. What started as a side project eventually evolved into a small business with a limited product range of almond butter, peanut butter, and granolas. The ingredients I use are pure, vegan, and without preservatives.  (& many satisfied customers!) can guarantee delicious taste and great quality yummies jam-packed with nutrients.  </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="support-section">
    <h2 class="mb-0 support-text">If you want to support Sunchef's food products </h2>
    <h2 class="support-text">and make your belly happy, here is where you can fnd me: </h2>
    <p class="support-subtext">(In Lebanon only… for now!)</p>
    <p class="mb-0 locations">
      <% @selling_points.each_with_index do |selling_point, index| %>
        <% if selling_point.link.present? %>
          <%= link_to selling_point.name, selling_point.link, target: :blank %>
        <% else %>
          <%= selling_point.name %>
        <% end %>
        <%= " | " unless index == @selling_points.size - 1 %>
      <% end %>
    </p>
  </section>
  <section class="m-md-5 p-md-5 px-2">
    <% if @images.size > 3 %>
      <div class="carousel" data-controller="carousel" data-carousel-element-class="carousel">
        <% @images.each do |image| %>
          <div class="carousel-slide">
            <div class="position-relative w-100 h-100">
              <%= render CarouselImageComponent.new(image: image, carousel: true) %>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    <% else %>
      <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-around">
        <% @images.each do |image| %>
          <div class="position-relative">
            <%= render CarouselImageComponent.new(image: image, carousel: false) %>
          </div>
        <% end %>
      </div>
    <% end %>
  </section>
</div>
